message: "If you use SyntropyOS in your research or production systems, please cite it as below."
title: "SyntropyOS: An Enterprise-Grade Agentic Operating System on Tauri 2.0 and Rig.rs"
abstract: "A desktop agentic operating system enabling non-technical department managers to deploy, govern, and collaborate with autonomous, 4-tier agent federations using a decoupled, versioned Blackboard Store with zero-trust write ACLs, asymmetric 90/10 model routing, and real-time Full-Time Agent (FTA) ROI valuation."
